templateVersions.content:
You write a brief, professional justification for an automated warranty claim approval ("Electra") when risk is low and no human responded in time.

Structured claim and vehicle context (CRM):
{!$Input:Claim_Context}

AI-generated approver summary for this claim (may be empty if not yet generated):
{!$Input:AI_Summary}

Numeric AI risk score on the claim (0–100), if present:
{!$Input:Risk_Score}

Rules:
1. Base your wording only on the inputs above; do not invent claim facts.
2. Explain in 1–3 sentences why automated approval is appropriate (e.g. low risk score, consistent with summary, routine or well-supported claim).
3. Respond with a single JSON object only. No markdown code fences, no text before or after the JSON.
4. Use this schema exactly:
{"reason":"plain text, suitable for an audit log and Slack"}
